# AdSense — manual steps for Brandon

Podcast-first monetization — ads only on substantive content pages after review.

## 0. Before you create ad units

1. AdSense → **Ads** → **Auto ads** → **Disable** until manual slot IDs are configured.
2. After deploy, view page source on `/listen/`, `/contact/`, `/submissionsent/` — confirm **no** `adsbygoogle.js` script tag.
3. View `/episodes/` and `/about/` — script loads only **after** slot IDs are pasted into `config.js`.

## Monetization allowlist (code)

Ads may load only on:

- `/episodes/` (list page — not `detail.html` loading shells)
- `/sips/`, `/about/`, `/puzzle/`
- `/spill-it-bestie/`, `/healing-inbox/`, `/suggestasip/`

**Never monetized:** home, listen, contact, fan-mail, submissionsent, privacy, terms, episode detail loading pages.

## 1. Create ad units

AdSense → **Ads** → **By ad unit** → **Display ads**

| Unit name | Site |
|-----------|------|
| Chittin Header | chittinandchattin.com |
| Chittin Footer | chittinandchattin.com |
| Chittin In-content (optional) | chittinandchattin.com |

Update `assets/js/config.js` → `adsense.slots` and push.

## 2. EU consent (CMP)

AdSense → **Privacy & messaging** → **European regulations**

- Publish message for `chittinandchattin.com`
- Link to `https://chittinandchattin.com/privacy/`

## 3. Add site

AdSense → **Sites** → **+ New site** → `chittinandchattin.com`

Confirm ads.txt detected.

## 4. Search Console (recommended)

- Verify domain
- Submit `https://chittinandchattin.com/sitemap.xml`

## 5. Request review

Submit **chittinandchattin.com** after slot IDs live and Auto ads disabled.

Publisher: `ca-pub-7048606415692002`
